CharacterName,Morphling,变体精灵
ClassDescription,"A fluid DOTA2 hero who commands surging waves, shifts freely between Strength and Agility, and morphs into foes.",来自 DOTA2 的水元素英雄，能化作波浪穿梭战场、在力量与敏捷之间自由转换，并变形为敌人形态。
ClassName,morphling//female,变体精灵
ClassName,morphling//male,变体精灵
ClassName,morphling//non-binary,变体精灵
EntityDescription,"A sentient elemental forged from living tidewater, capable of reshaping its physical attributes at will.",由活水潮汐凝聚而成的智慧元素，能随心重塑自身的力量与敏捷形态。
EntityName,waterkin,变体水灵
ItemDescription,A condensed sphere of living tidewater launched as infinite ranged ammunition from a sling.,由活水潮汐凝聚的远程水弹，可作为弹弓无限弹药发射。
ItemName,tidal orb,潮汐水弹
PropertyDescription,Ebb & Flow (Agility I): +10% movement speed and slight dodge chance.,潮涨潮落（潮落 I）：常驻移速 +10%，获得轻微闪避几率（变形期间依然生效）。
PropertyDescription,Ebb & Flow (Agility II): +20% movement speed and improved dodge chance.,潮涨潮落（潮落 II）：常驻移速 +20%，获得进阶闪避几率（变形期间依然生效）。
PropertyDescription,Ebb & Flow (Agility III): +30% movement speed and agile dodge chance.,潮涨潮落（潮落 III）：常驻移速 +30%，获得灵动闪避几率（变形期间依然生效）。
PropertyDescription,Ebb & Flow (Agility IV): +40% movement speed and high dodge chance.,潮涨潮落（潮落 IV）：常驻移速 +40%，获得高额闪避几率（变形期间依然生效）。
PropertyDescription,Ebb & Flow (Agility V): +50% movement speed (permanent quickness) and peak dodge chance.,潮涨潮落（潮落 V）：常驻移速 +50%（等效常驻迅捷），获得极高闪避几率（变形期间依然生效）。
PropertyDescription,Ebb & Flow (Strength I): Avoids grappling and mild permanent life recovery.,潮涨潮落（潮涨 I）：常驻抵抗抓取束缚，轻微加快生命恢复（变形期间依然生效）。
PropertyDescription,Ebb & Flow (Strength II): Avoids grappling and steady permanent life recovery.,潮涨潮落（潮涨 II）：常驻抵抗抓取束缚，稳定加快生命恢复（变形期间依然生效）。
PropertyDescription,"Ebb & Flow (Strength III): Immune to slowness, avoids grappling, and improved permanent life recovery.",潮涨潮落（潮涨 III）：常驻免疫减速、抵抗抓取束缚，显著加快生命恢复（变形期间依然生效）。
PropertyDescription,"Ebb & Flow (Strength IV): Immune to slowness, avoids grappling, and strong permanent life recovery.",潮涨潮落（潮涨 IV）：常驻免疫减速、抵抗抓取束缚，大幅加快生命恢复（变形期间依然生效）。
PropertyDescription,"Ebb & Flow (Strength V): Immune to slowness, avoids grappling, and permanent doubled life recovery.",潮涨潮落（潮涨 V）：常驻免疫减速、抵抗抓取束缚，100% 触发双倍生命恢复且不耗饱食度（变形期间依然生效）。
