RaceName,waterkin//female,变体水灵
RaceName,waterkin//male,变体水灵
RaceName,waterkin//non-binary,变体水灵
SpellDescription,"Assume the form of a targeted creature, copying its body, attributes, skills, and spells.",指向一名生物并化身为对方形态，复制其外形、属性、技能与法术。
SpellDescription,"Crush foes with a heavy torrent of water focused on strength, dealing light damage while reliably knocking them back and stunning them.",以偏重力量的重水洪流冲击目标，造成少量水系伤害并稳定击退与眩晕敌人。
SpellDescription,"Dissolve into a surging wave, blinking forward, splashing water damage around you, and briefly gaining phasing and displacement.",化作汹涌波浪向前闪烁突进，对周围敌人造成水波范围伤害，并短暂获得穿墙与幻影闪避。
SpellDescription,Release your morphed form and immediately return to your true waterkin body.,解除当前变形状态，立即切回变体水灵本体。
SpellDescription,"Shift toward agility (converting 1 to 5 STR & CON into DEX per cast by mastery), freely repeatable and empowering permanent Ebb speed and dodge.",向敏捷转换属性（随熟练度每次将 1~5 点力量与体质转化为等额敏捷，可自由多次转换），同时叠加常驻「潮落」移速与闪避。
SpellDescription,"Shift toward strength (converting 1 to 5 DEX into STR & CON per cast by mastery), freely repeatable while empowering permanent Flow slow resistance and life recovery and healing immediately.",向力量转换属性（随熟练度每次将 1~5 点敏捷转化为等额力量与体质，可自由多次转换），同时叠加常驻「潮涨」抗减速与生命恢复并立即回血。
SpellDescription,"Unleash a razor-sharp surge of water focused on agility, dealing heavy burst water damage to enemies.",以偏重敏捷的锋锐高压水波轰击目标，造成高额爆发水系伤害。
SpellName,adaptive strike agility,变体攻击·敏捷
SpellName,adaptive strike strength,变体攻击·力量
SpellName,morph,变形
SpellName,morph agility,属性转换·敏捷
SpellName,morph revert,解除变形
SpellName,morph strength,属性转换·力量
SpellName,waveform,波浪形态
